          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "бояться (boyátsya) from Proto-Slavic bojati sę — inherited. Vasmer relates it to Lithuanian bijótis, \"to fear\", and Sanskrit bibhéti, \"fears\"."
            }
          ]
        },
